--- Rosetta Code: Halt and catch fire
--- https://rosettacode.org/wiki/Halt_and_catch_fire
--- halt stops the program at once, in both modes, with its reason and its line
--- on stderr and exit status 1; nothing after it runs. (An int divided by zero,
--- 1 / 0, stops it too, with "division by zero".)

halt['halt and catch fire']
